# Build-Time Credentials
# These credentials are embedded in the binary during build
# This file is gitignored and will NOT be committed to GitHub
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.build
# 2. Fill in your actual credentials
# 3. Run: npm run tauri:build
# 4. The .exe will have these credentials embedded
# 5. Users get a working app without setup!

# Google OAuth (for Calendar/Tasks sync)
ATHELETIA_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here
ATHELETIA_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret_here

# A4F API Key (optional - for AI features)
# ATHELETIA_A4F_API_KEY=your_a4f_api_key_here
